WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.380
<i>♫ Rumbling, Rumbling, it's coming ♫</i>

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.290
<i>♫ Rumbling, Rumbling ♫</i>

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.260
<i>♫ Beware ♫</i>

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>♫ Coming for you ♫</i>

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.650
<i>♫ All I ever wanted to do was do right things ♫</i>

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:29.320
<i>♫ I've never wanted to be the king, I swear ♫</i>

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:34.280
<i>♫ All I ever wanted to do was save your life ♫</i>

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:39.410
<i>♫ I've never wanted to grab a knife, I swear ♫</i>

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:47.840
<i>♫ Tearless, fearless, burning, burning ♫</i>

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.090
<i>♫ You tell me what have I missed ♫</i>

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:54.680
<i>♫ Still wandering in the deep mist ♫</i>

00:00:56.970 --> 00:01:00.720
<i>♫ If I lose it all, slip and fall ♫</i>

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.560
<i>♫ I will never look away ♫</i>

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:09.480
<i>♫ If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all ♫</i>

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:13.400
<i>♫ If I lose it all outside the wall ♫</i>

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.740
<i>♫ Live to die another day ♫</i>

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.120
<i>♫ I don't want anything ♫</i>

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.500
<i>♫ I'm just here to... ♫</i>

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.540
<i>♫ Beware ♫</i>

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:34.980
Two Brothers

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:07.360
Galliard!

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.170
The Founding took the hit!

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:29.660
It has stopped moving!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.660
All right!

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.080
One more at the Beast!

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.520
Don't let them fire!

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.590
Just quiet already!

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.360
The Cart Titan!

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:44.810
We must do something about her first.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:45.800
Armin!

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.920
The houses are full of enemies!

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:53.920
Pull back!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.320
This place is no good!

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.730
We have to handle
the Marleyan soldiers first.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:00.890
Yeah.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.660
Surround them!

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:05.060
Assault them from behind!

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:11.950
Commander's right.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.990
Now's not the time to face
the Marleyan soldiers head-on.

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:16.670
We should get behind them.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:43.850
I fell...

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:45.950
to the ground...?

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.010
Did I...

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:50.870
....get shot?

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.530
Eren...

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.050
Porco, wake up!

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.710
Muster your strength!

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.840
Galliard!

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:15.970
I'm sorry...

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:17.370
I'm sorry, Reiner.

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.600
The truth is…

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.880
you weren't supposed
to be chosen as Warrior.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:27.310
I put you on a pedestal and
made my brother look bad.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:29.440
All to influence the army's
opinion of both of you.

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:33.740
I wanted... to protect my brother.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:39.660
General Magath!

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.440
He's alive?!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:43.780
Zeke!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:52.950
I will now... summon... the Titans.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:56.550
Wait!

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.430
Please wait!

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.600
Falco...

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:07.310
He drank your spinal fluid.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:08.940
Please don't Scream!

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.250
Mr. Zeke!

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.510
What... did he say?

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:17.130
You know, don't you?

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:21.410
I won the right to inherit the Beast
so they won't send my family to paradise!

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:22.400
Colt, let me go! Colt!

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:27.960
To be frank, I never knew what you were
thinking even before you betrayed us!

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.170
Not even once!

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.170
But...

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:33.510
I know you were not the type of person
who would drag children into this!

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:37.090
I won't tell you to just lay down
and let yourself be killed.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:41.080
But I want you to at least wait until
Falco is outside the range of your Scream!

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:43.970
Kill each other as much as
you want after that!

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:47.060
Kill as many Marleyans and
Eldians as you'd like to!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.060
But...

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.750
Don't drag my little brother into this!

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:52.980
Falco!

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.360
Get on, hurry!

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.670
Don't come here, Gabi!

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:00.650
Colt...

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:06.120
I understand well just how much
you care for your little brother.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.340
Mr. Zeke....

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:15.690
Which is why...

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:19.840
...it's a shame.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.190
Let me go!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.370
- Let go of me! Colt!
- It's all okay, Falco!

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.100
Your brother is here with you!

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:09.520
What the...?

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:13.270
Did our enemies... turned into Titans?

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.590
Hey! Get the anti-Titan rifle--

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.060
Do it. Falco.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.810
Colt...

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:10.890
Falco...

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.670
I can't hold down both
at the same time...

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:16.300
Eren will escape!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:19.760
Should I finish Falco?

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:24.380
...Me?

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:35.350
Eren!

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.680
Falco!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.800
He's biting my nape!

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.670
We finished him this time!

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.220
For sure!

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.840
We're safe for now.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.710
Dammit! Anyone here?!

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.440
Is everyone dead?

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:06.540
The only one left is the Founder.

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:09.480
You have no need for a head.

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:12.110
Give us your spinal fluid!

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:16.620
I was too late...

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:18.170
Shoot him down!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:24.060
It's over!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.080
It's already over for all of you!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.790
Is it over?

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.760
Eren can't use the power
of the Founding anymore.

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.710
We've completed our duty.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:48.990
Now I can... let them
take care of the rest, right?

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.700
I just have to undo my hardening armor...

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:55.050
...and it'll be the end for me.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.770
The one who will
inherit the Armored....

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.150
...is Falco.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:28.130
I used up even the power
to heal my body...

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:33.380
But... I'm not going down for nothing.

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:38.080
I saw Marcel's memories.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:43.660
He went all his way to trick the army
so they made a loser like you a Warrior.

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:47.130
To protect me.

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:49.690
Wait! Don't do it!

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:53.030
Porco!

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:56.780
Now it's clear, right?

00:10:57.450 --> 00:11:00.120
That I've always been better
than you until the end.

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:04.940
Eh?

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:07.900
Mr. Galliard?

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:25.840
Could it be...!

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:31.030
I'm glad you noticed, Eren!

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:35.690
I was just imitating Pieck,
but playing dead has worked perfectly!

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:37.970
Just a little more!

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:52.760
Come!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.340
Eren!

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.420
First off, Eren,

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:38.070
thank you for agreeing to
come all the way here.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:42.090
Yelena has told you about
my intentions.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:47.460
Will you support
the Eldian euthanasia plan?

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.820
Four years ago...

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:53.820
After a certain incident,
I saw my old man's memory.

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:58.910
It was his memory when he slaughtered
the entire royal family of the Walls.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:03.940
He went around and smashed
children like they were insects.

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.860
I can still feel it.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.790
If those children were alive,

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.670
the Founding Titan will
be passed down to the royal family.

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:15.300
The king will still be bound by
the vow to renounce the war,

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:19.330
and humanity inside the walls
would be forced to choose death.

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:23.320
The death of those children
allowed us to live.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.020
I see...

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:29.600
So you think... our father was right?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.280
No.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:33.080
He's wrong.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:38.400
And as someone raised by him,
I'm also wrong.

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:41.490
If Eldians hadn't been born,

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:47.110
the people of this city wouldn't have
to die because of our plan.

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:52.710
Never having to be born in this world
is the greatest salvation of all.

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:54.920
I'll do it.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:59.760
I'll put an end to the 2000-years history
ruled by Titan with my own hands.

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:03.720
I'll keep going forward
until that day comes.

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:06.180
Isn't that right, Brother?

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:10.190
Yeah...

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:12.980
Yeah, that's right.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:14.400
Let's do it.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.320
As much as I'd like to seal this off
with a firm handshake...

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:21.170
Well, I suppose we shouldn't be
making physical contact right now.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:24.540
So please, take this instead.

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:26.890
Eren.

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.900
Let's save everyone for sure.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.900
I dropped it.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:42.430
My stay at the hospital
must've dulled my reflex.

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:11.690
This place is...

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.400
The coordinate where
all paths converge...

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:16.690
...I think.

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.280
This must be where members
of the royal family come

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:22.200
when they inherit the Founding.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:25.150
When they made use of its power.

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:27.120
Brother...

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:30.510
I've been waiting for so long, Eren.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:37.090
It feels I've been here for years waiting
for you to recover and open your eyes.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:41.920
Years... have passed?

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:44.680
I'm not really sure.

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:48.140
Everything that took place here
passes in a flash out there.

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:51.080
Gabi blew your head off,

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:55.490
but we were able to make contact
before you passed on completely.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.170
We succeed.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:02.540
We've obtained the power of the Founder.

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:08.660
Someone's here.

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:09.990
Don't worry.

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:11.100
That is...

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.860
The Founder Ymir.

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:17.330
The Founder Ymir?

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.520
How do you know?

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:24.440
Who else would be wandering around
this place but the Founder Ymir herself?

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:27.340
Furthermore,

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:30.560
she was the one who rebuilt
half of my body with this soil

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.340
and brought me back to life.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:36.810
The Founder must be making
the Titans in this place.

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:41.690
Each time we seek for
the power of the Titan,

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.610
she uses her endless time
here to mold our bodies.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.530
All this time...

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:51.370
...in here, all alone?

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:53.450
Eren.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:55.810
You must command the Founder Ymir.

00:17:58.170 --> 00:18:01.700
Now's the time to make
our dream come true.

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.090
What are those chains?

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:09.590
Oh, now you notice these chains.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:13.200
Well, thank you for your concern.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:17.950
It's on me to take away my freedom here.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.680
In other words,
the vow to renounce war.

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:25.690
As we expected, you're the only one
who can move freely in this place.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:29.590
You're the only one who can
command the Founder Ymir.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:34.200
My dream, Mr. Ksaver's dream...

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.440
and your dream.

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:39.820
Please, save the world.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:44.930
Eren?

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:49.680
Tell the Founder this...

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:54.650
"Make it so all Eldians will never again
be capable of making children."

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:58.680
We can crush the Allied Forces with
the Rumbling after that.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:03.980
To euthanize every Eldians...

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:06.480
Eren...

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:11.330
There is no way I could ever accept
a plan so messed up like that.

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:13.320
Sorry, Brother.

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:17.910
I was just playing along
so I could get here.

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:29.630
So long as there are Eldians...

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.880
...this hell will never end!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:37.310
If you don't do this here,
this bloodshed will never stop.

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:42.140
The thing we've repeated so many times
will continue for eternity.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:45.980
Why, Eren?!

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:47.330
Tell me!

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:50.480
Because I was born into this world.

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:54.020
Founder Ymir.

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.870
Lend me your power.

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:07.400
I knew it, Eren.

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:11.720
I wanted to believe that
you would understand.

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:16.260
Is this also because you were
brainwashed by our father?!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:24.850
What is this...

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:26.910
What is going on?

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:31.190
In the long span it took
you to wake up...

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:33.000
I learned many things.

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:36.370
The Founder can make anything.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:39.380
Even these earthen chains.

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:43.650
So long as I, with the royal blood,
wish for it.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:49.000
Unlike the Kings of the Walls
throughout history,

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:53.260
I arrived here without being tainted
by the first king's ideology.

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:55.090
And then...

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:59.050
during the long time I spent
with the Founder in here,

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:02.670
I succeed in nullifying
the vow to renounce the war.

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:07.150
The Founder Ymir holds immense power,

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:11.180
but in reality, she's merely
a slave with no will of her own.

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:15.490
She believes all of those with
the royal blood to be her master,

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:17.180
and continues to submit to them.

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:21.280
I've obtained the power of the Founder.

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:23.860
Impossible...

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:28.020
You were merely the key
to achieve that, Eren.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:34.630
I'm glad I waited until I can
hear your true feelings.

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:38.560
It's not your fault.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:44.420
We're just pitiful victims, born to
that disgusting monster of a father.

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:49.520
However, I had another
father who rescued me.

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:53.530
And you need someone to rescue you as well.

00:21:54.110 --> 00:21:56.910
I will never abandon you.

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:00.160
I'll fix you with the power of the Founder!

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:01.870
Stop it, it's useless.

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:03.830
When I save the world...

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:05.700
...it will be together with you!

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:13.260
<i>♫ The iron bullet is the proof of justice ♫</i>

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:15.840
<i>♫ If it pierces through,

00:22:15.840 --> 00:22:18.560
<i>♫ But when I close my eyes and touch ♫</i>

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:23.100
<i>♫ I notice that the devil

00:22:23.890 --> 00:22:26.560
<i>♫ Why am I not good, but he's okay? ♫</i>

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.270
<i>♫ The only thing that 

00:22:29.270 --> 00:22:31.940
<i>♫ Don't lament on the fate that we're born ♫</i>

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:35.820
<i>♫ Because we're all free ♫</i>

00:22:35.820 --> 00:22:41.080
<i>♫ If only I have wings like birds ♫</i>

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:46.420
<i>♫ I can go anywhere I want ♫</i>

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:50.500
<i>♫ But if I don't have a place to return to ♫</i>

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:55.930
<i>♫ I'm sure I can't go anywhere ♫</i>

00:22:55.930 --> 00:23:00.890
<i>♫ I just simply hate living ♫</i>

00:23:01.270 --> 00:23:11.940
<i>♫ The world is cruel, but I still love you ♫</i>

00:23:11.940 --> 00:23:22.040
<i>♫ I will sacrifice anything to protect you ♫</i>

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:27.250
<i>♫ Even if it's a mistake to do so,

00:23:27.250 --> 00:23:33.670
<i>♫ Because the right thing

00:23:41.470 --> 00:23:43.640
The younger brother rejects
his older brother,

00:23:43.640 --> 00:23:46.140
and the older brother refuses
to abandon his younger brother.

00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:51.310
The brothers learn about the truth
at end of their path.

00:23:51.880 --> 00:23:54.980
Next time, "Memories of the Future."
